{"ID":"20230709205048-chuwbrp","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230709205048-chuwbrp","name":"RigidBody","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230709205048-chuwbrp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230709222003-ojxm5gi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230709221456-glq2tun\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230709222003-ojxm5gi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"U1L13-1——物理系统之刚体","type":"doc","updated":"20251031170515"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709222003-ojxm5gi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20230709222003-ojxm5gi","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚体"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":" (Rigidbody)"}]},{"ID":"20230709205218-pztbv02","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20230709205218-pztbv02","updated":"20230709222911"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709205209-c3mry5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709205209-c3mry5z","updated":"20240321165543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刚体 (Rigidbody)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是实现游戏对象的物理行为的主要组件。连接刚体后，对象将立即响应重力。\n如果还添加了一个或多个__碰撞体__组件，则游戏对象会因发生碰撞而移动。\n由于刚体组件会接管附加到的游戏对象的运动，因此不应试图借助脚本通过更改"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://docs.unity.cn/cn/2021.1/Manual/class-Transform.html","TextMarkTextContent":"变换"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"属性（如位置和旋转）来移动游戏对象。\n相反，应该施加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-error-background); color: var(--b3-card-error-color);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"__力__"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-card-error-background); color: var(--b3-card-error-color);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来推动游戏对象并让物理引擎计算结果。\n在某些情况下，可能希望游戏对象具有刚体，并让刚体的运动摆脱物理引擎的控制。\n例如，可能希望直接从脚本代码控制角色，但仍允许触发器检测角色（请参阅"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://docs.unity.cn/cn/2021.1/Manual/CollidersOverview.html","TextMarkTextContent":"碰撞体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主题下的_触发器_）。\n脚本产生的这种非物理运动称为_运动学_运动。刚体组件有一个名为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Is Kinematic"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的属性，\n该属性可以让刚体摆脱物理引擎的控制，并允许通过脚本以运动学方式来移动刚体。\n可以通过脚本来更改 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Is Kinematic"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的值，从而为某个对象开启和关闭物理引擎，但这会产生性能开销，应谨慎使用。\n有关这些组件的设置和脚本选项的更多详细信息，请参阅"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://docs.unity.cn/cn/2021.1/Manual/class-Rigidbody.html","TextMarkTextContent":"刚体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://docs.unity.cn/cn/2021.1/Manual/class-Rigidbody2D.html","TextMarkTextContent":"2D 刚体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参考页面。"}]},{"ID":"20230709222858-ybj3fav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709222858-ybj3fav","style":"text-align: right;","updated":"20230709222911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"text-align: right;"},"TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://docs.unity.cn/cn/2021.1/Manual/RigidbodiesOverview.html","TextMarkTextContent":"刚体概述 - Unity 手册"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: parent-style=\"text-align: right;\"}"}]},{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"}]},{"ID":"20230709221401-c8eftqw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20230709221401-c8eftqw","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚体参数"}]},{"ID":"20251031163549-qmgxivk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031163549-qmgxivk","updated":"20251031163549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"碰撞产生的必要条件：两个物体都有碰撞器、至少一个物体有刚体"}]},{"ID":"20230710010829-k3c8c7w","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20230710010829-k3c8c7w","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20230709214209-2ay3y7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709214209-2ay3y7w","updated":"20250425103824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20230709214209-a9340yc.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230709213147-rfe8el0","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213147-rfe8el0","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213146-aln4v7q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20230709213146-aln4v7q","updated":"20230709214019"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213146-quw9w1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213146-quw9w1j","updated":"20230709214019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Mass - 质量（默认为千克）"}]},{"ID":"20251031163619-evrasp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031163619-evrasp1","updated":"20251031163619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"质量越大惯性越大"}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213207-gw1qmnz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20230709213207-gw1qmnz","updated":"20230709213207"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213207-zn9eiec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213207-zn9eiec","updated":"20251031163623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Drag - 空气阻力"}]},{"ID":"20251031163624-v21k9q0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031163624-v21k9q0","updated":"20251031163626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根据力移动对象时影响对象的空气阻力大小，0 表示没有空气阻力"}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213236-sor6w2q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20230709213236-sor6w2q","updated":"20230709213236"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213236-y46e41r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213236-y46e41r","updated":"20230709214024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Angular Drag - 根据扭矩旋转对象时影响对象的空气阻力大小"}]},{"ID":"20251031163639-7c0cifz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031163639-7c0cifz","updated":"20251031163639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"0 表示没有空气阻力。"}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213239-2bjik6i","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213239-2bjik6i","updated":"20230709213239"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213239-3u11csc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213239-3u11csc","updated":"20230709213946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Use Gravity - 是否受重力影响"}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213242-l65apwf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20230709213242-l65apwf","updated":"20251031163715"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213242-ekh7qp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213242-ekh7qp3","updated":"20251031163715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Is Kinematic - 是否是运动学物体"}]},{"ID":"20251031163700-c3nta4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031163700-c3nta4j","updated":"20251031163707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果启用此选项，则对象将不会被物理引擎驱动，只能通过 ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Transform"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​) 对其进行操作。对于移动平台，或者如果要动画化附加了 HingeJoint 的刚体，此属性将非常有用。"}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213245-b6j8wk4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20230709213245-b6j8wk4","updated":"20251031163733"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213245-gpkh1xf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213245-gpkh1xf","updated":"20230709214035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Interpolate - 插值运算，让刚体物体移动更平滑"}]},{"ID":"20230709213253-lks6tyd","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213253-lks6tyd","updated":"20251031163733"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213251-db49tz5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213251-db49tz5","updated":"20251031163729"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213251-mycjtya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213251-mycjtya","updated":"20251031163729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"None：不应用插值运算"}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213258-h1y7897","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213258-h1y7897","updated":"20251031163732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213258-k9x1o6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213258-k9x1o6l","updated":"20251031163732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Interpolate：根据前一帧的变换来平滑变换。"}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213300-bjnqcma","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213300-bjnqcma","updated":"20251031163733"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213300-z6s2ri7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213300-z6s2ri7","updated":"20251031163733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Extrapolate：差值运算，根据下一帧的估计变换来平滑变换。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213605-rxnrlg2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20230709213605-rxnrlg2","updated":"20230709213605"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213605-y5njbr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213605-y5njbr1","updated":"20230709213656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Constraints - 约束 - 对刚体运动的限制"}]},{"ID":"20230709213658-5nstw9i","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213658-5nstw9i","updated":"20230709213658"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213657-9pt2c73","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213657-9pt2c73","updated":"20230709213657"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213657-4lzym8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213657-4lzym8g","updated":"20230709213706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Freeze Position - 有选择地停止刚体沿世界 X、Y 和 Z 轴的移动。"}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213707-0f4ewdv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213707-0f4ewdv","updated":"20230709213707"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213707-fhyh0od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213707-fhyh0od","updated":"20230709213707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Freeze Rotation - 有选择地停止刚体围绕局部 X、Y 和 Z 轴旋转。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213636-0ne035u","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"0","id":"20230709213636-0ne035u","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213636-fdr9ijw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213636-fdr9ijw","updated":"20251031163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Collision Detection - 碰撞检测模式"}]},{"ID":"20251031170346-hsrxg7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170346-hsrxg7f","updated":"20251031170416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不同原理碰撞检测各有优劣，详见下方："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251031164516-ctl5i75","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"物理碰撞检测类型"}]},{"ID":"20251031170339-6tnj9xa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170339-6tnj9xa","updated":"20251031170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251031170339-nwim45p.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251031170445-mtw0k48","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170445-mtw0k48","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170444-inlpwak","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170444-inlpwak","updated":"20251031170444"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170444-61fei5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170444-61fei5v","updated":"20251031170444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete（离散检测）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170445-22qsftf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170445-22qsftf","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170445-k2ls1lj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170445-k2ls1lj","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous（连续检测）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170445-l9km06l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170445-l9km06l","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170445-gtep25l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170445-gtep25l","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Dynamic（连续动态检测）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170445-ibgk5m7","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170445-ibgk5m7","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170445-tsdchj8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170445-tsdchj8","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170445-qt6ieb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170445-qt6ieb6","updated":"20251031170445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative（连续推测式检测）\n"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20251031164516-ctl5i75","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031164516-ctl5i75","updated":"20251031170515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理碰撞检测类型"}]},{"ID":"20230709213801-mlau2g0","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213801-mlau2g0","updated":"20251031170235"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213801-syoopcm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213801-syoopcm","updated":"20251031165223"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213801-8e167do","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213801-8e167do","updated":"20230709213806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete（离散检测）"}]},{"ID":"20251031165239-wpfm7gl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165239-wpfm7gl","updated":"20251031165756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对场景中的所有其他碰撞体使用离散碰撞检测。其他碰撞体在测试碰撞时会使用离散碰撞检测。用于正常碰撞（这是默认值）"}]},{"ID":"20251031165755-3lv10m7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165755-3lv10m7","updated":"20251031165755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原理：每个物体只在 固定物理步长的采样点 检查是否与其他碰撞体重叠"}]},{"ID":"20251031165755-poliofd","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251031165755-poliofd","updated":"20251031165755"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031165755-n2jcmt6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031165755-n2jcmt6","updated":"20251031165755"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031165755-zepgh4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165755-zepgh4d","updated":"20251031165755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优点：性能最好，开销最小"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031165755-7j3xxyj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031165755-7j3xxyj","updated":"20251031165755"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031165755-o1iawjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165755-o1iawjz","updated":"20251031165755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缺点：高速小物体可能在两帧之间跳过另一个碰撞体,出现穿透现象"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031165755-i3h1znt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031165755-i3h1znt","updated":"20251031165755"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031165755-76ff4r7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165755-76ff4r7","updated":"20251031165755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用场景：绝大多数常速移动的物体（角色、箱子、环境物件）"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213807-zqj64jk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213807-zqj64jk","updated":"20251031170235"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213807-gyalo6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213807-gyalo6s","updated":"20230709214126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous（连续检测）"}]},{"ID":"20251031165242-d50j94r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165242-d50j94r","updated":"20251031170235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对动态碰撞体（具有刚体）使用离散碰撞检测，并对静态碰撞体（没有刚体）使用连续碰撞检测。\n设置为连续动态 (Continuous Dynamic) 的刚体将在测试与该刚体的碰撞时使用连续碰撞检测，其他刚体将使用离散碰撞检测。\n（此属性对物理性能有很大影响，如果没有快速对象的碰撞问题，请将其保留为 Discrete 设置）"}]},{"ID":"20251031165830-hdg00xp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165830-hdg00xp","updated":"20251031165830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原理：在两帧之间会额外做 运动轨迹的扫掠检测（sweep test），以减少穿透"}]},{"ID":"20251031165830-17zys5x","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251031165830-17zys5x","updated":"20251031165830"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031165830-w4sauf1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031165830-w4sauf1","updated":"20251031165830"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031165830-wnfrvoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165830-wnfrvoy","updated":"20251031165830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优点：大幅降低高速物体穿透的概率"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031165830-ldyfvph","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031165830-ldyfvph","updated":"20251031165830"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031165830-1yh4av9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165830-1yh4av9","updated":"20251031165830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缺点：CPU 开销比 Discrete 高"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031165830-phj4d2q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031165830-phj4d2q","updated":"20251031165830"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031165830-3ljv086","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165830-3ljv086","updated":"20251031165830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用场景：非主角的小型高速物体（例如子弹、飞镖、投射物）"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213819-cr1la76","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213819-cr1la76","updated":"20251031170204"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213819-dj73y2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213819-dj73y2a","updated":"20230709214122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Dynamic（连续动态检测）"}]},{"ID":"20251031165246-lth0fj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165246-lth0fj4","updated":"20251031170204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性能消耗最高\n对设置为连续 (Continuous) 和连续动态 (Continuous Dynamic) 碰撞的游戏对象使用连续碰撞检测。\n还将对静态碰撞体（没有刚体）使用连续碰撞检测。对于所有其他碰撞体，使用离散碰撞检测。\n用于快速移动的对象。"}]},{"ID":"20251031165842-pekb493","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165842-pekb493","updated":"20251031165845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原理：比 Continuous（连续检测） 更严格，专门用于高速移动的刚体，它会检测所有 Continuous （连续检测）、Continuous Dynamic （连续动态检测）的物体"}]},{"ID":"20251031165842-wlejvuk","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251031165842-wlejvuk","updated":"20251031165842"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031165842-w1wswfp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031165842-w1wswfp","updated":"20251031165842"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031165842-t7o3y4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165842-t7o3y4y","updated":"20251031165842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优点：最稳妥地避免穿透"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031165842-cbh7a31","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031165842-cbh7a31","updated":"20251031165842"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031165842-3ooapgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165842-3ooapgr","updated":"20251031165842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缺点：开销最高，不适合大规模使用"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031165842-q2vcwsn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031165842-q2vcwsn","updated":"20251031165842"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031165842-ekio9ys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165842-ekio9ys","updated":"20251031165842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用场景：关键的高速动态物体（例如主角手里的高速挥舞武器、主角发射的重要投射物）"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20230709213822-q1lyjae","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20230709213822-q1lyjae","updated":"20251031170111"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709213822-9sjylnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709213822-9sjylnr","updated":"20230709213822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative（连续推测检测）"}]},{"ID":"20251031165248-zjyox7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165248-zjyox7i","updated":"20251031165248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对刚体和碰撞体使用推测性连续碰撞检测。该方法通常比连续碰撞检测的成本更低。"}]},{"ID":"20251031170111-wlefx3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170111-wlefx3f","updated":"20251031170111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原理：一种相对新的模式（比 Continuous（连续检测） 更轻量），会在下一帧前预测可能的碰撞，即使物体很小很快，也能避免大多数穿透"}]},{"ID":"20251031170111-r5sc7f8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170111-r5sc7f8","updated":"20251031170111"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170111-bo51pds","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170111-bo51pds","updated":"20251031170111"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170111-erwfg2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170111-erwfg2r","updated":"20251031170111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优点：比 Continuous Dynamic（连续动态检测） 更省性能；避免了很多小物体穿透"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170111-hvdpded","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170111-hvdpded","updated":"20251031170111"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170111-sbc8zmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170111-sbc8zmx","updated":"20251031170111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缺点：推测结果可能带来误判（没撞上也认为撞上了），偶尔出现虚假碰撞"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170111-hf003yw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170111-hf003yw","updated":"20251031170111"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170111-idm7hix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170111-idm7hix","updated":"20251031170111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用场景：中高速物体，既需要避免穿透，又不想消耗太多性能的情况"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031165122-4ee0t3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031165122-4ee0t3r","updated":"20251031165210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不同碰撞检测类型碰撞体相互使用的碰撞检测类型如下"}]},{"ID":"20251031164544-ul29syf","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"min-width: 60px;|min-width: 60px;|min-width: 60px;|min-width: 60px;|min-width: 60px;|min-width: 60px;","id":"20251031164544-ul29syf","updated":"20251031170510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th"},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无刚体碰撞盒"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（离散检测）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（连续检测）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Dynamic"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（连续动态检测）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（连续推测检测）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无刚体碰撞盒"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不检测碰撞"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（离散检测）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（连续检测）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Dynamic"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（连续动态检测）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（连续推测检测）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170514-ziy8apm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170514-ziy8apm","updated":"20251031170515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性能消耗关系：Continuous Dynamic \u003e Continuous Speculative \u003e Continuous \u003e Discrete"}]},{"ID":"20230709221430-3o23p4i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20230709221430-3o23p4i","updated":"20230709221528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚体睡眠"}]},{"ID":"20230709221454-nx60pj5","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20230709221454-nx60pj5","updated":"20240321165628"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230709221430-6a7fzt0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709221430-6a7fzt0","updated":"20240321165617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当刚体移动速度低于规定的最小线性速度或转速时，物理引擎会认为刚体已经停止。\n发生这种情况时，游戏对象在受到碰撞或力之前不会再次移动，因此将其设置为“睡眠”模式。\n这种优化意味着，在刚体下一次被“唤醒”（即再次进入运动状态）之前，不会花费处理器时间来更新刚体。"}]},{"ID":"20230709221430-m9un8es","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709221430-m9un8es","updated":"20240321165628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在大多数情况下，刚体组件的睡眠和唤醒是透明发生的。\n但是，如果通过修改__变换__位置将静态碰撞体（即，没有刚体的碰撞体）移入游戏对象或远离游戏对象，则可能无法唤醒游戏对象。\n这种情况下可能会导致问题，例如，已经从刚体游戏对象下面移走地板时，刚体游戏对象会悬在空中。\n在这种情况下，可以使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"WakeUp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 函数显式唤醒游戏对象。有关睡眠的更多信息，请参阅"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://docs.unity.cn/cn/2021.1/Manual/class-Rigidbody.html","TextMarkTextContent":"刚体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://docs.unity.cn/cn/2021.1/Manual/class-Rigidbody2D.html","TextMarkTextContent":"2D 刚体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组件页面。"}]},{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"}]},{"ID":"20230709221456-glq2tun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230709221456-glq2tun","updated":"20240321165637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解决方法："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref code","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230710004233-33p3fee","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"rigidBody.WakeUp()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240321165632-h960wul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321165632-h960wul"}}]}